# Biometric model weights. 38 MB of third-party ONNX binaries, fetched by
# backend/scripts/fetch_biometric_models.py, which verifies a pinned SHA-256 and
# writes a NOTICE beside them. Deliberately not committed: a recogniser is only
# real if the weights are actually on disk, so a clone without them is a
# simulation until the fetch script is run, and that state is what `auto` reports.
backend/.models/

